@host = http://localhost:5080
### Examinar los datos de los tres casos
GET {{host}}/cases

### Facturación
POST {{host}}/cases/support/evaluate?threshold=0.8

### Caso ambiguo: comparar con threshold=0.5
POST {{host}}/cases/returns/evaluate?threshold=0.8

### Incidencia crítica
POST {{host}}/cases/incident/evaluate?threshold=0.8

### Lote con resumen
POST {{host}}/cases/batch?threshold=0.8

### Texto propio: requiere Demo:Simulated=false y clave
POST {{host}}/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"I was charged twice. Please help today."}
